<https://acme.example/knowledge/glossary/active-user> <http://schema.org/keywords> "glossary" .
<https://acme.example/knowledge/glossary/active-user> <http://schema.org/name> "Active User" .
<https://acme.example/knowledge/glossary/active-user> <http://schema.org/text> "# Definition\n\nAn **active user** is any `user_id` that produced at least one *qualifying event*\nduring the period under consideration. Used by the\n[Weekly Active Users](/metrics/weekly-active-users.md) metric." .
<https://acme.example/knowledge/glossary/active-user> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://schema.org/DefinedTerm> .
<https://acme.example/knowledge/glossary/active-user> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://wiki.acme.example/rfc/metric-defs> .
<https://acme.example/knowledge/glossary/active-user> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A user who has performed at least one qualifying event in the period of interest." .
